WEBVTT

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:30.561
Kaj to pomeni?

00:12:30.561 --> 00:12:35.773
To pomeni, da ko gremo spat,
bi v zadnjih 15 sekundah, preden zaspimo,

00:12:35.773 --> 00:12:37.626
vsi morali pomisliti:

00:12:37.626 --> 00:12:39.943
"Presneto, vesel sem, da Irska obstaja."

00:12:39.943 --> 00:12:42.141
(smeh)

00:12:42.141 --> 00:12:49.238
In ... (aplavz)

00:12:49.668 --> 00:12:54.748
V breznu hude gospodarske recesije
mislim, da je v tem pomemben nauk:

00:12:54.756 --> 00:12:56.712
če ne pozabite na
svoje mednarodne obveze,

00:12:56.712 --> 00:12:58.852
medtem ko se trudite
obnoviti lastno gospodarstvo,

00:12:58.852 --> 00:13:00.090
je to nekaj res posebnega.